  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811663/youtube_icon_bcbanf.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fEsvPsnqJpz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811736/discord_icon_bg_rp4omx.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761815764/kofi_icon_bg_sy3foi.png\" alt=\"Ko‑fi\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/PlaIsMe\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811682/github_icon_bg_wmtjei.png\" alt=\"Github\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a></p><p><strong>煩人村民：玩家NPC武器擴展</strong> 是一個附加模組，為「煩人村民」模組中的玩家NPC添加更多武器，當他們被生成時可使用。</p><p style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center\">⚠️ 歡迎建議其他模組加入此擴展。<br>但武器需保持平衡，且能用鐵、鑽石製作，非來自Boss戰鬥</p><p><strong>相容模組列表：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeons-and-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>地下城與戰鬥</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod-rapier-moveset-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>史詩戰鬥 - 細劍動作附加</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>史詩騎士：盾牌、盔甲與武器</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">史詩戰鬥：復甦</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/samurai-dynasty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">武士王朝</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡單劍</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達武器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇蹟武器</a></li>\n</ul>",
